<%# Broadcast fragment for async delivery mode (decision #001).

  DecisionPollJob broadcast_replace_to's this into the slot's Turbo Stream once a
  decision is ready. It carries ONLY the browser-safe payload (build prompt §5):
  frame_url (which the server built from the asset_token so the token never
  crosses the wire), dimensions, label and sponsor — never the secret key, never
  the bare asset_token.

  It renders a data-only signal element that the `wavebird` Stimulus controller
  watches via a `targetConnected` callback; the controller hands the payload to
  window.wavebird.renderPlacement (fill) or clearPlacement (no-fill). No inline
  <script> — CSP-friendly, and the vendor renderer stays the single source of
  truth for the iframe + viewability beacons. %>
<div id="<%= stream_name %>"
     data-wavebird-target="signal"
     data-wavebird-payload="<%= payload.to_json %>"
     hidden></div>
